{"name":"Catwalk","hex":"#4a4649","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"catwalk","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["An elevated enclosed passage providing access fore and aft from the bridge of a merchant vessel.","Any similar elevated walkway."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/catwalk"}],"entries":[{"title":"Catwalk (Canadian TV series)","blocks":[{"text":"Catwalk is a Canadian musical drama television series that ran for 49 episodes on the YTV network from 1992 until 1994. The series' first season aired in syndication in the United States, while the second season aired on MTV."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/c/c7/Catwalkseriesintro.jpg/330px-Catwalkseriesintro.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Catwalk_(Canadian_TV_series)","wikidata":"Q691969"},{"title":"Catwalk (RuPaul's Drag Race)","blocks":[{"text":"\"Catwalk\" is the fourteenth episode of the fourteenth season of the American television series RuPaul's Drag Race. It originally aired on April 8, 2022. The episode's main challenge tasks the contestants with writing, recording, and performing choreography to original verses in RuPaul's song \"Catwalk\". Lady Camden wins the main challenge and no one is eliminated from the competition. The episode won in the Outstanding Production Design for a Variety or Reality Series category at the 74th Primetime Creative Arts Emmy and was nominated in the Variety, Reality, or Competition Series category at the Art Directors Guild Awards 2022."}],"link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Catwalk_(RuPaul's_Drag_Race)","wikidata":"Q125342493"},{"title":"Fashion show","blocks":[{"text":"A fashion show is an event put on by a fashion designer to showcase their upcoming line of clothing and/or accessories during a fashion week. Fashion shows debut every season, particularly the spring/summer and fall/winter seasons. This is where designers 